---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
import { CONDITIONS } from '../../data/conditions';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="What We Treat"
  description="Chronic back pain, sciatica, post-surgical return-to-sport, masters athlete injuries — treated with Cognitive Functional Therapy and 30 years of strength coaching in Denver."
>
  <section class="px-6 pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="font-serif italic text-[var(--color-primary)] mb-3 text-lg">What we treat</p>
      <h1 class="mb-8">Pain that outlasted the treatments you already tried</h1>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Almost everyone who walks into my studio has already been somewhere else first. Physical therapy that ended
          before they were better. Chiropractic that helped for a week at a time. An injection that bought a quiet
          month. A scan that "showed something" but didn't explain the pain.
        </p>
        <p>
          The common thread in those cases is a pain system stuck in protection mode — and a body that lost capacity
          while everyone focused on the sore spot. My work addresses both: calm the system down with
          <a href="/what-we-treat/cognitive-functional-therapy">Cognitive Functional Therapy</a>, then rebuild real
          strength so the change lasts. One-on-one, 60–90 minutes at a time, with a clear endpoint.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-16 bg-[var(--color-surface)] border-y border-[var(--color-border)]">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        {CONDITIONS.map(c => (
          <a
            href={`/what-we-treat/${c.slug}`}
            class="block p-7 border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-background)] hover:border-[var(--color-primary)] hover:shadow-sm transition-all no-underline"
          >
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-[var(--color-primary)] text-xl md:text-2xl">{c.navTitle}</h2>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] text-base leading-relaxed">{c.metaDescription}</p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-6">Not sure your situation fits a category?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-8">
        Most don't, exactly. A 30-minute consultation sorts out whether this approach fits your case — before you
        commit to anything.
      </p>
      <a href="/book" class="cta-button text-lg">Book a consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
